# VRBO — scale with the display, don't forget the front

VRBO screens render in **more than one host**. A change that looks right on one route and broken on another is a regression.

## Hosts you must re-check

| Route | What it is | How size works |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/vrbo-v2` | Five-up overview (Display 1, Display 2, three phones) | Fluid frames; UI uses **cqh/cqw** |
| `/vrbo-left` `/vrbo-right` | Full-bleed kiosk | Inner panel is 2160×3840 + `transform: scale(...)` |
| `/vrbo-ip1` `/vrbo-ip2` `/vrbo-ip3` | Guest phones | Own phone frame / screen container |

After any VRBO visual or motion edit, check **the overview and the full-bleed page**, not only the page you had open.

- Display 2 / ranking: `/vrbo-v2` **and** `/vrbo-right`
- Display 1 / chat: `/vrbo-v2` **and** `/vrbo-left`
- Phones: `/vrbo-v2` **and** the matching `/vrbo-ip*`

## Proportional scale (do not hardcode design px)

Design canvas is **2160×3840**. Convert with the container, same as the rest of Display 1/2:

```css
/* GOOD — rides /vrbo-v2 thumbnail and /vrbo-right kiosk */
left: calc(160 / var(--design-w) * 100cqw);
height: calc(138 / var(--design-h) * 100cqh);
font-size: calc(148 / var(--design-h) * 100cqh);
```

```css
/* BAD — only correct if the parent is literally 2160×3840 CSS pixels */
left: 160px;
height: 138px;
font-size: 148px;
width: 2160px;
top: 2160px;
```

`.vrbo-v2-chat` and `.vrbo-v2-rank` already set `--design-w: 2160`, `--design-h: 3840`, and `container-type: size`. Use that. JS motion travel must also be container-relative (`calc(N / var(--design-h) * 100cqh)` or `%`), not raw `translateY(17px)` on overview frames.

`ScaledDisplayCanvas` / `.vrbo-v2-displayHd__panel` is the **only** place that is a literal 2160×3840 box plus uniform scale. Do not add a second inner 2160 canvas on `/vrbo-v2`. Do not stretch text and photos independently.

## New work cannot delete old work

Keep every screen and input that already worked unless this message explicitly removes it.

- Opening loop on Display 2 waiting **and** “Pulling it all together” after everyone submits
- Left chat, phones, summary, results, finale
- Click **and** UDP where both existed

Do not “simplify” a layout to one host. If you are unsure, open `/vrbo-v2` first — that is where fixed 2160 px breaks show up.